/Title (How can smaller developer tool companies compete? The February 2026 update creates a genuine opportunity for smaller brands. Google now evaluates expertise per topic. A newer site with deep niche expertise can outrank an established domain with shallow coverage. Focus on building content clusters in specific verticals, amplify brand mentions on developer-focused platforms, and create content that positions your tool in the right categories.)
